00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.700
Now, this is not Donald Trump's tax returns.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.990
I know that there are people who maybe misunderstood
the headlines around this.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.650
This is not Trump's tax returns.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:28.039
Pro Publica has obtained some Donald Trump
tax documents and they show exactly what we've

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:33.320
predicted for a long time, which is that Donald
