00:01:35.849 --> 00:01:38.149
That is something I'm sure Donald Trump is
doing.

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:41.579
A and Michael Cohen told us that that's what
Donald Trump is doing, but this is actually

00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:47.289
more Donald Trump is actually lying about
how much rent the buildings are taking in,

00:01:47.289 --> 00:01:51.719
which is a much more calculated and specific
type of lie.

00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:55.590
Some might call it fraud, and in fact, the
number of real estate professionals are calling

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.590
it exactly that.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.529
So here's one example.

00:01:58.529 --> 00:02:03.889
Donald Trump told his lender that the buildings
earn twice as much rent.

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:09.810
That one building earns twice as much rent
as what he told tax authorities in the same

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.250
year in 2017 okay?

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.770
Both can't be true.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.049
Those are lies.

00:02:15.049 --> 00:02:16.940
This is financial fraud.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.239
Another example, Trump's building at 40 wall
street.

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:24.569
I would walk by this building every day because
our a David Pakman show studios in New York

00:02:24.569 --> 00:02:29.440
city, we're like a block from Trump's building
at 40 wall street.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.420
I'd walk by it every day.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:39.090
Trump told a lender that 40 wall street went
from being 59% leased to 95% leased in a period

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.750
of a few years.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:45.939
But then around the same time that he was
telling the lender it was 59% least, he told

00:02:45.939 --> 00:02:49.430
