00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.640
Uh, but whatever the impetus was, it doesn't
make sense.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:11.800
And that's what's immediately revealed by
these documents.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:17.250
Sometimes the exact motivation for the discrepancies
